# NOTE (Windows/PC only): package.json scripts use POSIX `VAR=value cmd`
# syntax. On Windows, run once in this repo's folder:
#   npm config set script-shell "C:\Program Files\Git\bin\bash.exe"
# That stores it in your *user* npm config so it doesn't break macOS/Linux
# checkouts of this project. Do NOT put script-shell in this file.
